// A sum or difference as KIELER writes it into C, `initial state A if - -i > 0 do x = 1 go to A`. KIELER runs it: x
// is 0, 0, 0.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A if - -i > 0 do x = 1 go to A }
